	(lib_symbols)
	(text_box "DESIGN NOTES - USB DEV\n\nDEV DOMAIN - powered from Dev USB-C VBUS via LDO (3V3_DEV). Must not back-power target.\nDev USB-C receptacle (UFP, 5.1k Rd on CC) -> ESD -> USB2514B 4-port hub (24 MHz xtal).\n  Port1: P4 USB-Serial/JTAG\n  Port2: C5 USB-Serial/JTAG\n  Port3: FT2232H (A = P4 UART0 + DTR/RTS auto-reset, B = C5 UART0 + auto-reset)\n  Port4: RP2040 + QSPI flash running debugprobe (CMSIS-DAP): SWD + UART to m1421, GPIO = m1421 UART mux select, RESET\nAll Dev->target signals through SN74LVC2T45-type buffers powered from the target side."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
